 $4$ rth power: 
 $$\begin{align*}
\left(\frac {u + \frac 1u}{2}\right)^4
&= \cos^4 x = \frac {u^4 + 4u^3\frac 1u + 6u^2\frac 1{u^2} + 4u\frac 1{u3} + \frac 1{u^4}}{2^4} \\
&= \frac {\left(\left(u^4 + \frac 1{u^4}\right) + 4\left(u^2 + \frac 1{u^2}\right) + 6\right)}{2^4}\\
& = \frac {2\color{red}{\cos 4x} + 4\times 2 \times \cos 2x + 6}{2^4}
\end{align*}$$ 
