 $$I=\int_0^{\pi / 2} \arctan{ \left( \frac{r \cos(\theta)\sin(\theta)}{\sqrt{1+r^2}} \right) }\, d \theta =\int_0^{\pi / 2} \arctan{ \left(k \sin(2\theta)\right) }\, d \theta$$ 
