 \begin{equation*}
1 + \cdots + (i-1) + (i-1) + (i+1) + \cdots + (j-1)+(j-1)+ (j+1) + \cdots + n
\end{equation*} 
 This is precisely  $\frac{n(n+1)}{2}-2$ . 
